(7696041, 1262104, 25787, '<td valign="top">Long exposure blur in the water is nice. Focus is off on the waterfall though. Only sharp thing is the tree on the right.</td>', 'Long exposure blur in the water is nice. Focus is off on the waterfall though. Only sharp thing is the tree on the right.', '2021-06-14 22:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
